    "one_line": "Test the user experience on each surface, against the surface's properties and guidelines (for a browser page, how it lays out across screen sizes) and the screen design from Design the work: the running build is tested in the testing environment, by tools and by a person who walks it on each declared surface, against what Manage surfaces declares that surface offers and what every design on it must handle, and against the screen design the work was built to, and each finding goes back to the developer or to a person.",
