    "one_line": "Once the built work runs in the testing environment, opens on each declared surface, by a part that is not the builder, each screen the screen design shows at each screen size the surface names, keeps a picture of it with the text and the controls it shows, checks what a tool can check, and records each result with what was checked and where.",
