     "bi-4"
    ],
    "status": "proposed",
    "one_line": "Once the built work runs in the testing environment, a person who is not the builder, named by the product owner, uses the slice end to end on its surface at each screen size the surface names, and judges each screen against the surface's properties, its guidelines and the screen design, recording what they found, where, and how they walked.",
