     "bi-4"
    ],
    "status": "proposed",
    "one_line": "Gives one verdict for the built work against each surface's properties and guidelines and the screen design, with a pass or a fail for every part, and sends each finding back as a handoff plan to the developer when the builder can fix it alone, or to the product owner when a person must decide.",
